From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] GS: present each picture once and super-sampled output

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0065: GS: present each published picture once and swap on the display refresh
- 0066: GS: super-sampled, double-resolution output with the game's final blit replaced
